  "title": "L3Harris Receives $170 Million Radio Order From Central European Nation",
  "summary": "L3Harris Technologies has received a $170 million order from a Central European nation for its Falcon® IV family of communication systems. The technology will support ongoing force modernization initiatives and will enhance secure, seamless interoperability with U.S. and NATO partners.",
